## Findings

**One root cause: the network path from ts-travel-service to ts-seat-service.** Every call from travel to seat carries a near-constant extra ~4.77 s. The seat server spans stay at about 50 ms, and the seat service's own work is unchanged. The overhead is absent in the normal period and absent on travel's other paths (to basic and route) and on travel-plan's calls to seat. Hubble shows no drops on the connection, which points to delay rather than loss. I could not fully separate `network_delay` from `http_slow` with this telemetry; I chose `network_delay` because the extra time is a fixed delay on one pod pair. Travel also has a few failed calls, which is consistent with the same link.

**Propagation to the user-facing tier:** the slow travel responses delay route-plan, preserve and travel-plan, which in turn delay ts-ui-dashboard. Route-plan's calls to travel took about 28.9 s, and travel-plan's calls to route-plan about 29.3 s. Preserve's calls to travel took about 11.6 s. The ts-ui-dashboard → ts-travel-service calls went from about 1.1 s to 31 s p95.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel-service",
      "fault_kind": "network_delay",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abnormal' p, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile((CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)-CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT))/1e6,0.5),1) med_overhead_ms, round(approx_quantile((CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)-CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT))/1e6,0.05),1) p05_overhead_ms, round(approx_quantile((CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)-CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT))/1e6,0.95),1) p95_overhead_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-service' AND s.service_name='ts-seat-service' UNION ALL SELECT 'normal', count(*), round(approx_quantile((CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)-CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT))/1e6,0.5),1), round(approx_quantile((CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)-CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT))/1e6,0.05),1), round(approx_quantile((CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)-CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT))/1e6,0.95),1) FROM normal_traces c JOIN normal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-service' AND s.service_name='ts-seat-service'",
          "claim": "Travel-to-seat client calls exceed seat server time by a constant ~4.77s in abnormal, versus ~4ms normal."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abnormal' p, c.service_name c_svc, s.service_name s_svc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) client_p95_ms, round(approx_quantile(CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) server_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-service' AND s.service_name IN ('ts-seat-service','ts-basic-service','ts-route-service') GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "Seat server p95 stays ~55ms while travel's client p95 to seat is ~4.9s; basic and route stay fast."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT c.service_name c_svc, s.service_name s_svc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) client_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND s.service_name='ts-seat-service' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Travel-plan's calls to the same seat service stay fast (~60ms p95), so the delay is specific to the travel pod pair."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-travel-service",
      "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT c.service_name c_svc, s.service_name s_svc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) client_p95_ms, round(approx_quantile(CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) server_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND s.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Route-plan's calls to travel-service take ~28.9s p95 in abnormal, versus ~0.5s in normal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-travel-service",
      "to": "ts-preserve-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT c.service_name c_svc, s.service_name s_svc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) client_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND s.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Preserve's calls to travel-service take ~11.6s p95 in abnormal, versus ~0.8s in normal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "to": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT c.service_name c_svc, s.service_name s_svc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(CAST(c.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) client_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND s.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Travel-plan's calls to route-plan take ~29.4s p95 in abnormal, versus ~2.0s in normal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT s.service_name, s.span_name, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(CAST(s.duration AS BIGINT)/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces s WHERE s.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' AND s.span_name LIKE '%travelPlan%' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Ui-dashboard's travelPlan requests reach ~20s p95 in abnormal, as travel-plan calls stall downstream."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
